# ==========================================================================
# FLRP :: CODEOWNERS — review ownership for the CORE repo (flrp-server)
# ==========================================================================
# Read by both Gitea and GitHub (root CODEOWNERS). Combined with `main` branch
# protection (require CODEOWNERS review), this routes review of each path to the
# right owners. It does NOT hide files — everyone with repo access can read
# everything; it controls who must approve changes to each area on `main`.
#
# REPLACE the placeholder @FLRP/... team handles with your real Gitea/GitHub
# org teams. Order matters: the LAST matching pattern wins.
#
# See docs/REPOSITORY_STRATEGY.md. Content areas (vehicles/eup/maps/departments)
# live in their OWN repos with their OWN CODEOWNERS — not here.
# ==========================================================================

# Default owner for anything not matched below.
